# E32C functional core (Python)

ISA spec: [docs/isa/spec.md](docs/isa/spec.md). Opcodes: [docs/isa/opcodes.yaml](docs/isa/opcodes.yaml).

## Dev

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest -q
```

## CLI

```bash
python -m cli.sim --help
```
